@cc [owner:PopDaph;tdraier,label:security] collab-internal-routes
Every internal route MUST answer 401 unless the request carries the configured internal secret,
and MUST answer 401 to every request when none is configured. `index.ts` checks it once
(`collabInternalAuth`), for every route mounted below it. Each route's own access rules are
contracts next to its handler (`collab-internal-document-*`).
